{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S01-S02、S04-S05有一部分注意力落在怕给对方添负担、怕暴露需要感上，略偏向自我暴露的顾虑。\",\n    \"S07-S09较集中于对方是否需要自己，容易让共同亲密的幸福与失去它的痛楚具体化为对自身陪伴价值的担忧。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03只想表达自己有多喜欢这份亲近，没有X中想确认对方是否也有同样感受的念头，双向共享的亲密感稍弱。\",\n    \"S04把顾虑落在表达太满会不会破坏眼下的自在，略偏向维持相处状态的顾虑。\",\n    \"S13进一步转向追问即使得到不变的承诺，未来是否真的能一直好，容易把主线带向承诺的可信度和未来稳定性，而不完全是亲密幸福本身无法留住的痛楚。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地把双向亲近的幸福、想留住这份幸福的愿望、明知无法保证永远的痛楚，以及因此产生的自我保护冲动缠在了一起。Y也保留了核心情感，但S13更明显地转向了对承诺能否保证未来的追问，使主线稍微偏向未来稳定性的焦虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "66fcb31a-d2cc-4902-9e6b-22968d0589e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T094028593300Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:40:49.410489+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c803a866772f1bfca73f4225b766aa8fb811bc38fe64ebd9555d2e3d2aec3e78", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1ef